<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali on Wednesday chaired a cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>-Tunisian television signed an agreement with France's Conseil Superieur de l'Audiovisuel to broadcast its programme by cable in France.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Parliament's sub-committees continue to discuss the 1997 draft budget behind closed doors.</p>
</text>
